Thresholds:
- (a) TDD (DDDSU, one direction per slot): max(DL p99, UL p99) > 0.5 ms first at 4 ports
- (a) FDD (DL+UL in the same 0.5 ms interval): DL p99 + UL p99 > 0.5 ms first at 2 ports
- (b) GPU exceeds 50% of the 0.5 ms slot (DL or UL p50 > 0.25 ms): first at 64 ports
- Stopped early: both GPU DL and UL p50 exceed 50% of the 0.5 ms slot; further ports are not meaningful for realtime

